il UKHSA confirms.", 'landing_page': 'https://www.ukradon.org/information/ukmaps', 'bbox': [-8.1771, 49.8647, 1.7629, 60.8608], 'geometry_type': 'polygon', 'concepts_hint': ['natural-hazard', 'uk-ground-pack'], 'endpoints': [{'protocol': 'arcgis-featureserver', 'url': 'https://services1.arcgis.com/0IrmI40n5ZYxTUrV/arcgis/rest/services/Maximum_radon_potential_UK_and_IoM/FeatureServer/0', 'service_url': 'https://services1.arcgis.com/0IrmI40n5ZYxTUrV/arcgis/rest/services/Maximum_radon_potential_UK_and_IoM/FeatureServer', 'capabilities': ['query'], 'info': {'class_field': 'CLASS_MAX', 'class_values': [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], 'advice_field': 'Advice', 'nation': 'UK', 'completeness': 'complete', 'completeness_note': 'all of the UK and the Isle of Man, 1 km squares', 'data_date': '2025-07-24', 'data_date_source': 'layer editing info'}, 'check_url': 'https://services1.arcgis.com/0IrmI40n5ZYxTUrV/arcgis/rest/services/Maximum_radon_potential_UK_and_IoM/FeatureServer/0/query?where=1%3D1&returnCountOnly=true&f=json'}, {'protocol': 'landing', 'url': 'https://www.ukradon.org/information/ukmaps'}], '_ctx': {'publisher': 'UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)', 'publisher_type': 'public-body', 'country': 'GB', 'seed_catalog': 'curated:uk-ground.yaml', 'discovered_via': 'curated'}}, {'kind': 'record', 'id': 'uk-derby-potentially-contaminated-sites', 'title': 'Potentially Contaminated Sites, Derby (Derby City Council)', 'publisher': 'Derby City Council', 'publisher_type': 'local-gov', 'country': 'GB', 'abstract': "Sites in Derby that may be contaminated because of past use, from the council's survey of historic maps: Land_Use and Industry_Prior give the past use, Map_Date the map it came from. Not a finding of contamination. Fields: class field Industry_Prior, use field Land_Use, date field Map_Date. Completeness: partial (Derby City only; the atlas found published contaminated-land layers for 5 councils: Derby, Lambeth, Sheffield, Clackmannanshire (and Carlisle, whose server refuses the atla